Port 2222
AddressFamily any
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0
ListenAddress ::

HostKey /run/codex-remote-devbox/ssh_host_ed25519_key
PidFile /run/codex-remote-devbox/sshd.pid

AllowUsers codex
PubkeyAuthentication yes
AuthenticationMethods publickey
AuthorizedKeysFile /run/codex-remote-devbox/authorized_keys
StrictModes yes
MaxAuthTries 3
LoginGraceTime 30

PermitRootLogin no
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PermitEmptyPasswords no
UsePAM no

AllowAgentForwarding no
AllowTcpForwarding local
AllowStreamLocalForwarding no
PermitOpen localhost:* 127.0.0.1:* [::1]:*
PermitListen none
GatewayPorts no
X11Forwarding no
PermitTunnel no
PermitUserRC no
PermitUserEnvironment no

PrintMotd no
PrintLastLog no
Banner none
DebianBanner no
VersionAddendum none

ClientAliveInterval 60
ClientAliveCountMax 3
TCPKeepAlive yes
UseDNS no

AcceptEnv LANG LC_*
Subsystem sftp internal-sftp
LogLevel INFO
